@baseUrl = http://localhost:5052



# * ================ USERS

### Get all Users
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users
Accept: application/json

### Get user by Id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/1
Accept: application/json

### Post user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

